        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Ohio, Nelsonville, Clarington, Orbiston, Buchtel, Cleveland\n- Roads: Ohio State Route 78\n- Companies: Car and Driver, Cleveland Institute of Electronics\n- Topics: scenic highways, magazine circulation, distance learning technical colleges\n\nFacts:\n- Ohio State Route 78 is a state highway in Ohio that runs 105 miles from Nelsonville to Clarington.\n- Car and Driver has called Ohio State Route 78 one of the most scenic highways in the United States.\n- Orbiston is located along Ohio State Route 78, 1.8 miles north-northeast of Buchtel.\n- Car and Driver has a total circulation of 1.23 million.\n- Cleveland Institute of Electronics is a privately held, for-profit distance learning technical college in Cleveland, Ohio.",
